{"id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-partial-function.md","title":"部分函数与部分相等","display":"df-partial-function — 部分函数与部分相等","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-partial-function","aliases":["20-df-partial-function"],"display":"df-partial-function — 部分函数与部分相等","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 2.1.7；Notation 中的部分函数约定","source_pdf_pages":[60],"source_printed_pages":[24],"depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-partial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-partial-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-function — 部分函数与部分相等"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.1.7；Notation 中的部分函数约定"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>24</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\">\\(f,g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\\)</span>。采用 ZFC 集合、自然数、有限序列和有限递归作为基础语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\bigl((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f\\Rightarrow y=z\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f):=\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f):=\\{y:\\exists\\vec x\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f\\},\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\qquad\nf(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vec x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\simeq g(\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(f(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\land g(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists y\\bigl(f(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\bigl((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f\\Rightarrow y=z\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f):=\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f):=\\{y:\\exists\\vec x\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f\\},\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\qquad\nf(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vec x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\simeq g(\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(f(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\land g(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists y\\bigl(f(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>部分函数用单值关系表示，未定义不是额外的数值。函数相等表示图相等。量词中的输出变量由相应存在量词绑定。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.1.7；Notation 中的部分函数约定；印刷页 24；PDF 第 60 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\bigl((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f\\Rightarrow y=z\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f):=\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f):=\\{y:\\exists\\vec x\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f\\},\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\qquad\nf(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vec x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\simeq g(\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(f(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\land g(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists y\\bigl(f(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1672,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"8cea21e174a04417","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"13c94185789a6bef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-p